            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Malayalam for to go higher, then the Malayalam for to lift up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: താഴ്ത്തുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താഴ്ത്തുക — tāḻttuka — \"to lower\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കടക്കാരൻ സാധനങ്ങളുടെ വില താഴ്ത്തി. kaṭakkāran sādhanaṅṅaḷuṭe vila tāḻtti. The shopkeeper lowered the prices of the goods."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: താഴ്ത്തി, tāḻtti."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The causative of താഴുക, to sink; താഴെ, below, is the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താഴ്ത്തുക (tāḻttuka) is native Dravidian, the causative of താഴുക, \"to sink, to come low\" (DEDR 3178), the root of താഴെ, \"below\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
