          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉറപ്പാക്കുക (uṟappākkuka) is a native Malayalam compound: ഉറപ്പ്, \"firmness, assurance\" (DEDR 721), and ആക്കുക, \"to make\" (DEDR 333): to make a thing firm."
            }
