          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മെച്ചപ്പെടുത്തുക (meccappeṭuttuka) is built on മെച്ചം, \"an advantage, the better of a thing\", which DEDR 4841 lists as Malayalam meccam, \"excellency, superiority\", in an article on height and the top of things; -പ്പെടുത്തുക, \"to cause to be\", comes from native പെടുക (DEDR 3853)."
            }
